WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.421 --> 00:00:03.148
- He's a Nigerian billionaire
and founder of the

00:00:03.148 --> 00:00:04.525
Dangote Group.

00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:07.837
His company operates in Nigeria
and other African countries.

00:00:07.837 --> 00:00:12.439
He has an estimated net worth
of 18.6 billion dollars.

00:00:12.439 --> 00:00:13.883
He's Aliko Dandote,

00:00:13.883 --> 00:00:17.383
and here are his top 10 rules for success.

00:00:19.425 --> 00:00:20.541
- Well to be a good leader.

00:00:20.541 --> 00:00:22.471
You have to be a very good listener.

00:00:22.471 --> 00:00:23.917
You have to listen to people,

00:00:23.917 --> 00:00:27.150
you have to also to quite relative advice.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.879
You have to make sure that it is not

00:00:29.879 --> 00:00:31.762
what you tell people to do.

00:00:31.762 --> 00:00:34.144
You have to crack your brains

00:00:34.144 --> 00:00:37.855
and have quite a lot of what you call

00:00:37.855 --> 00:00:40.350
advice from your own team.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.668
It has to be a teamwork,

00:00:41.668 --> 00:00:43.742
because there's no way you can make it

00:00:43.742 --> 00:00:46.224
as a person without a good team.

00:00:46.224 --> 00:00:47.691
- You must be consistent.

00:00:47.691 --> 00:00:49.627
When you try a business and you start,

00:00:49.627 --> 00:00:52.497
you might have hiccups here and there.

00:00:52.497 --> 00:00:54.431
It does not mean that that
business is not going to work,

00:00:54.431 --> 00:00:55.824
there must be challenges.

00:00:55.824 --> 00:00:57.617
In fact what I keep saying is that

00:00:57.617 --> 00:01:00.314
life without challenges
is very, very boring.

00:01:00.314 --> 00:01:03.145
So if you have challenges
you just have to know

00:01:03.145 --> 00:01:05.848
how to work out and work
around these challenges,

00:01:05.848 --> 00:01:08.246
and you'll be successful
once you are consistent.

00:01:08.246 --> 00:01:10.771
What business doesn't like
is for you to try something

00:01:10.771 --> 00:01:13.633
and then once you have one or two problems

00:01:13.633 --> 00:01:16.151
now you want to change or
move into another business.

00:01:16.151 --> 00:01:18.472
That doesn't work in business at all.

00:01:18.472 --> 00:01:20.469
The way that the data is,

00:01:20.469 --> 00:01:24.280
you need to have a lot of
information identified to you

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:26.346
so it will allow you to make decisions.

00:01:26.346 --> 00:01:29.096
To also take the right decisions.

00:01:30.784 --> 00:01:33.451
What I was doing five years ago,

00:01:35.706 --> 00:01:37.129
if I tried to do them without

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:39.551
the information that we have today,

00:01:39.551 --> 00:01:41.964
it's just not going to happen at all.

00:01:41.964 --> 00:01:45.388
Well the problem with some of
our young graduation today,

00:01:45.388 --> 00:01:47.187
they just want to jump and see

00:01:47.187 --> 00:01:49.700
themselves up there overnight.

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:51.718
It doesn't really happen.

00:01:51.718 --> 00:01:54.752
What you need to do is
to be very, very focused,

00:01:54.752 --> 00:01:56.411
as a person,

00:01:56.411 --> 00:01:59.727
and be dedicated to
whatever that you are doing.

00:01:59.727 --> 00:02:01.101
It is not really good for you to now

00:02:01.101 --> 00:02:02.209
go out and try something,

00:02:02.209 --> 00:02:04.994
then after a month you just
say 'No, it doesn't work'.

00:02:04.994 --> 00:02:08.011
You jump into something else.

00:02:08.011 --> 00:02:10.896
I think you need to be very, very focused

00:02:10.896 --> 00:02:11.838
in what you are doing.

00:02:11.838 --> 00:02:12.977
Once you believe in what you are doing,

00:02:12.977 --> 00:02:15.935
you should not take your
either business or job

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:19.005
as something that you must do.

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:22.076
Okay, you must take it
as part of your hobby.

00:02:22.076 --> 00:02:24.574
If it's part of your hobby,
then you do it better.

00:02:24.574 --> 00:02:26.281
You want to try to think ahead.

00:02:26.281 --> 00:02:29.233
In business sometimes what's good today

00:02:29.233 --> 00:02:31.150
might not be good tomorrow.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:33.007
So you need to look at,

00:02:33.007 --> 00:02:34.226
if you have the means,

00:02:34.226 --> 00:02:37.720
there's nothing really
like diversification.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:42.279
Sometimes you do quite a
lot of diversification,

00:02:42.279 --> 00:02:45.256
and then you consolidate
before you move forward.

00:02:45.256 --> 00:02:47.264
You can not just keep
expanding and expanding,

00:02:47.264 --> 00:02:49.399
because sometimes when you over expand,

00:02:49.399 --> 00:02:52.518
it comes possible to prices overages.

00:02:52.518 --> 00:02:56.685
So you need at least once
in a while to consolidate.

00:02:59.317 --> 00:03:02.084
When you look at, you
know, it is really common

00:03:02.084 --> 00:03:04.453
for somebody to leave banking

00:03:04.453 --> 00:03:07.264
and go and start something totally new.

00:03:07.264 --> 00:03:10.818
Especially in an area
of events management.

00:03:10.818 --> 00:03:13.180
At the time that she left the bank,

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:14.395
which was 10 years ago.

00:03:14.395 --> 00:03:18.512
Nobody thought that something
like events management

00:03:18.512 --> 00:03:19.911
would actually succeed,

00:03:19.911 --> 00:03:20.933
but I mean it is good,

00:03:20.933 --> 00:03:23.596
this is really what you
call entrepreneurship,

00:03:23.596 --> 00:03:24.820
and also a vision.

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:28.945
She had a vision and she is
able to actualize our vision.

00:03:28.945 --> 00:03:33.507
Just like myself, I
remember one time I went to

00:03:33.507 --> 00:03:37.101
address a retrieval at
First Bank of Nigeria.

00:03:37.101 --> 00:03:40.679
When I was selling in
First Bank of Nigeria.

00:03:40.679 --> 00:03:42.419
This is where Dangote is going to be

00:03:42.419 --> 00:03:43.803
in the next five years.

00:03:43.803 --> 00:03:46.365
I was not really that big
at the time that I went

00:03:46.365 --> 00:03:48.053
there to address them.

00:03:48.053 --> 00:03:50.815
I'm sure they couldn't really believe

00:03:50.815 --> 00:03:52.503
what I was saying then,

00:03:52.503 --> 00:03:55.586
but I remember at a point the MG said

00:03:57.369 --> 00:04:00.736
they are really shocked at how we actually

00:04:00.736 --> 00:04:05.067
been able to make it and
also actualize our vision.

00:04:05.067 --> 00:04:08.344
So I think with this
thing that she has done,

00:04:08.344 --> 00:04:10.211
I personally believe that this is

00:04:10.211 --> 00:04:12.297
just the beginning of the journey.

00:04:12.297 --> 00:04:14.135
Because she has the vision and I'm sure

00:04:14.135 --> 00:04:15.373
if she continues to do it,

00:04:15.373 --> 00:04:18.772
this can turn into another big business.

00:04:18.772 --> 00:04:20.272
Like I always say,

00:04:21.547 --> 00:04:24.157
look for one entrepreneur,

00:04:24.157 --> 00:04:25.505
there are no boundaries.

00:04:25.505 --> 00:04:26.971
Not only are there no boundaries,

00:04:26.971 --> 00:04:31.441
you can actually excel much
more than your own expectation.

00:04:31.441 --> 00:04:34.211
That's really what I expect
of an entrepreneur to be.

00:04:34.211 --> 00:04:35.614
Not to just just say

00:04:35.614 --> 00:04:38.606
okay fine I have a vision
and only achieve that vision.

00:04:38.606 --> 00:04:40.938
You need to have a vision and a mission

00:04:40.938 --> 00:04:43.366
so then you can actually actualize it

00:04:43.366 --> 00:04:44.645
and also excel.

00:04:44.645 --> 00:04:48.728
I had somebody who came
to interview me one time,

00:04:50.095 --> 00:04:54.262
and I told him that yes,
three, four, five years ago,

00:04:55.138 --> 00:04:59.305
I never ever expected myself
to be on the Forbes list,

00:05:00.564 --> 00:05:03.533
but right now the vision that I have,

00:05:03.533 --> 00:05:05.441
and also my own mission,

00:05:05.441 --> 00:05:07.596
is actually to be on top of the light.

00:05:07.596 --> 00:05:09.439
Not even where I am today.

00:05:09.439 --> 00:05:14.109
That's really how a
visionary person should be.

00:05:14.109 --> 00:05:14.942
Hard work.

00:05:14.942 --> 00:05:17.200
I mean that we are very focused,

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.089
we are a very focused company.

00:05:19.089 --> 00:05:22.183
We don't really go into things
that we don't understand.

00:05:22.183 --> 00:05:25.571
Any business that I
don't understand as well,

00:05:25.571 --> 00:05:26.898
I don't do it at all.

00:05:26.898 --> 00:05:30.420
That's really why we're successful.

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:34.303
To be an entrepreneur and
also to be a visionary person,

00:05:34.303 --> 00:05:37.171
you have to actually be very, very bold.

00:05:37.171 --> 00:05:40.748
You have to be ready to
take calculated risks.

00:05:40.748 --> 00:05:44.276
Not just any risks, you have
to take a calculated risk.

00:05:44.276 --> 00:05:46.330
You have to think big, if you think small,

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:48.936
you'll always have been small in life.

00:05:48.936 --> 00:05:51.795
The way that we operate as a company,

00:05:51.795 --> 00:05:53.503
especially in Dangote,

00:05:53.503 --> 00:05:56.727
just like earlier I said we have a vision.

00:05:56.727 --> 00:05:58.824
That vision will have a strategy

00:05:58.824 --> 00:06:00.814
of how we're going to achieve the vision.

00:06:00.814 --> 00:06:04.198
Which we do normally do
over a period of five years.

00:06:04.198 --> 00:06:07.448
Like today, we know where we are going.

00:06:08.366 --> 00:06:10.306
Even this investment that I announced of

00:06:10.306 --> 00:06:12.982
400 million dollars here.

00:06:12.982 --> 00:06:16.446
I didn't just sit down on
my own and just say it.

00:06:16.446 --> 00:06:21.270
It is part of our strategy
plan to invest in Kenya.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.311
To be serious, if you want
to be the next Dangote,

00:06:24.311 --> 00:06:25.865
is that,

00:06:25.865 --> 00:06:27.480
you have to have a very big heart.

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:31.986
You have to take quite a lot
of risks, calculated risks.

00:06:31.986 --> 00:06:34.863
First of all you have to
make sure that you're honest.

00:06:34.863 --> 00:06:38.019
You must make sure that
you don't destroy the name.

00:06:38.019 --> 00:06:39.676
Because your name is very important.

00:06:39.676 --> 00:06:43.729
That the most valuable asset
that you have going forward.

00:06:43.729 --> 00:06:45.585
If you don't have a good
name, even the banks.

00:06:45.585 --> 00:06:47.189
It doesn't matter how big you are,

00:06:47.189 --> 00:06:48.498
they're not going to touch.

00:06:48.498 --> 00:06:49.331
- [Female] True.

00:06:49.331 --> 00:06:50.759
- So you must make sure that you have

00:06:50.759 --> 00:06:52.676
a very, very good name.

00:06:53.616 --> 00:06:56.530
Number three, you have to make sure that

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:59.909
you say that look, nothing is impossible.

00:06:59.909 --> 00:07:01.667
Once you say that yes
nothing is impossible,

00:07:01.667 --> 00:07:04.583
it means that you can
actually achieve that target.

00:07:04.583 --> 00:07:05.727
- Thank you so much for watching.

00:07:05.727 --> 00:07:08.670
I made this video because
Narie Abba asked me to.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.474
So if there's a famous
entrepreneur that you

00:07:10.474 --> 00:07:11.736
want me to profile next,

00:07:11.736 --> 00:07:14.260
leave it in the comments below
and I'll see what I can do.

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.866
I'd also love to know
which of Aliko Dangote's

00:07:16.866 --> 00:07:19.526
top 10 rules had the
biggest impact on you.

00:07:19.526 --> 00:07:22.105
Leave it in the comments, I'm
going to join the discussion.

00:07:22.105 --> 00:07:23.425
Thank you so much for watching,

00:07:23.425 --> 00:07:24.723
choose to believe,

00:07:24.723 --> 00:07:26.640
and I'll see you soon.

